78
00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.570
See on säinas

79
00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.970
Ongi säinas?

80
00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.640
No näed,
sa tulime püüdma latikat samme,

81
00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:38.520
