133
00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.650
Ja püüame seisu vees.

134
00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.740
Siis on meil tark, vastupidi,
hästi palju seda

135
00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:27.430
